    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續能源與應用",
    "sub_ename": "SUSTAINABLE ENERGY AND ITS APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹綠色能源和永續發展的概念，如何建立一個永續的能源系統為主題，有系統地闡述了能源與經濟發展、能源與社會進步、能源與環境、能源安全等問題，也同時介紹了國內外關於能源需求和供應的展望和應用成果。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce the concept of green energy and sustainable development, how to build a sustainable energy system as the theme, and systematically explain the issues of energy and economic development, energy and social progress, energy and environment, energy security, etc. At the same time, the outlook and application results of energy demand and supply in the world were also introduced.",
